ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn the supermarket, there are originally 60 bottles of drinks. The number of soda, juice, and coffee is the same. After a few days, Manager Zhao says to Manager Li, \"Soda is the most popular, juice sells okay, almost no one likes to drink coffee.\" Manager Li counts and indeed, there are 8 bottles of juice that do not sell.\n\n[Question]\nHow many bottles of soda does Manager Li estimate are left after counting?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After counting, Manager Li estimates that there are 10 bottles of soda left\nB. After counting, Manager Li estimates that there are 7 bottles of soda left\nC. After counting, Manager Li estimates that there are 2 bottles of soda left\nD. After counting, Manager Li estimates that there are 8 bottles of soda left","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0015011459999174051,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e258d6006945d280232f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368088630,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"87c30ac05850446291bee215e2a8a073"}